        "answer": {
          "short": "The constant 5 was not multiplied by 4.",
          "worked": "Both terms in $2x+5$ must be multiplied by 4: $4(2x+5)=8x+20$, not $8x+5$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      },
      {
        "id": "binomial-numerator-r33-diagnose-1-b",
